      "url": "https://x.com/higgsfield_ai/status/2123565811713380530"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1712267009483022336",
      "conversation_id": "2123565731879244249",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T23:55:17.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123565809213571440"
      ],
      "id": "2123565809213571440",
      "lang": "en",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 2,
        "impression_count": 1119,
        "like_count": 4,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "Save these for your next build:\n\n&gt; Start with the cockpit and one leg, run the walk test before you add detail\n&gt; Ask for the price before Claude rents a GPU\n&gt; Render one test frame before the full run\n\nhttps://t.co/WWpwlkbQny",
      "url": "https://x.com/higgsfield_ai/status/2123565809213571440"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1712267009483022336",
      "conversation_id": "2123565731879244249",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T23:55:16.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123565806227521828"
      ],
      "id": "2123565806227521828",
      "lang": "en",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 149,
        "like_count": 0,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 2,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "Step 4: render it on Higgsfield GPU Harness.\n\nType /gpu in the same chat. Claude quotes the hourly price, waits for your yes, renders one test frame, then the full loop.\n\nOur run: 62 frames at 1080p on one L40S in under 7 minutes. 16.79 credits. https://t.co/ThZnI3ii7I",
      "url": "https://x.com/higgsfield_ai/status/2123565806227521828"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1712267009483022336",
      "conversation_id": "2123565731879244249",
      "created_at": "2026-11-19T23:55:10.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2123565780973576557"
      ],
      "id": "2123565780973576557",
      "lang": "en",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 0,
        "impression_count": 160,
        "like_count": 0,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "Step 3: check the paint with numbers, not your eyes.\n\nClaude baked four 4K colour maps, then compared each triangle's map colour with its source colour.\n\nA 12 px bake margin bled into the next part: 0.6-1.4% mismatch. At 4 px: zero on every triangle wider than 1.5 px. https://t.co/jqEbJLKFtj",
      "url": "https://x.com/higgsfield_ai/status/2123565780973576557"
    }
